SUMMARY:Let’s Play Chess/Board Games!
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\n**For the
  more casual/social board gamers\,** I'll have a healthy variety of other 
 light to mid weight board games with me that support upwards of 8 to 10 pl
 ayers (that's where I'll be). **For the chess players specifically:** I'm 
 cross promoting this with another group event that's happening at the same
  time and place\, so feel free to jump in with them. Here's a link to thei
 r event: Checkout this Meetup with North NJ Tournament Chess Masters In Tr
 aining: [https://meetu.ps/e/PPr6D/1dLbRS/](https://meetu.ps/e/PPr6D/1dLbRS
 /)\n\nWe will be meeting at Fort Nonsense Brewery in Randolph\, NJ! This e
 stablishment sells an assortment of small snack items and alcoholic bevera
 ges\, but personal food and drink can be brought to the venue. If anyone j
 oining this event would like to place an order\, let us know\, we can pitc
 h in.\n\nSee you there!\n\nNOTE: If you are not attending the event\, plea
 se change your RSVP accordingly!
